        Black higher: W ${adv.black_higher.white_wins} D ${adv.black_higher.draws} B ${adv.black_higher.black_wins} → White score ${scorePct(adv.black_higher.white_wins, adv.black_higher.draws, adv.black_higher.white_wins + adv.black_higher.draws + adv.black_higher.black_wins)}%<br>
