        Missing White Elo: ${dq.missing_white_elo}<br>
        Missing Black Elo: ${dq.missing_black_elo}<br>
        Missing ECO: ${dq.missing_eco}<br>
        Missing opening: ${dq.missing_opening}<br>
        Missing termination: ${dq.missing_termination}<br>
        Missing time control: ${dq.missing_time_control}<br>
        Missing platform ID: ${dq.missing_platform_id}<br>
        Source username NULL: ${dq.source_username_null_count}<br>
        Unknown result: ${dq.unknown_result_count}`;
